/* ---------- THE HIGH FALL: the one signature stunt (PLAN.md, Stunts). She starts it herself: at the tower's edge she
   says "Watch this!", and when she runs or jumps off it the stunt takes over. It cannot fail: slow motion on the
   drop, the camera follows her down, the windows open and the neighbours cheer, the party's bouncy castle catches
   her, a flip off it, she sticks the landing: NAILED IT! Under 6 s from the edge to control coming back. ---------- */
